<p class="Paragraph SCXW172049671 BCX8" style="margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background-color:transparent;"><span lang="en-us" class="TextRun SCXW172049671 BCX8" style="margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:8pt;line-height:11px;font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_EmbeddedFont', 'Aptos_MSFontService', sans-serif;">User login</span><span lang="en-us" class="TextRun SCXW172049671 BCX8" style="margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:8pt;line-height:11px;font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_EmbeddedFont', 'Aptos_MSFontService', sans-serif;font-weight:bold;"> T_FIX is used for FIX (order management)</span><span class="EOP SCXW172049671 BCX8" style="margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:8pt;line-height:11px;font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_EmbeddedFont', 'Aptos_MSFontService', sans-serif;"> </span></p>
